: "QJdFoj.png", "id": "1100946686944915", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569478_1100946690278248_6714567350181429248_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w--vmz7Hw2MQ7kNvwEzOOAK&_nc_oc=Adkhad9wC4OC7rJ6tV4fX1flg8JORbX-__Bg8nPWvxYtfZ9dCpPQB2qHcBHCRcirlLw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvnfvQuT9H73TCsCrQ5BokHRDBUD3oCAupAYbxxBUFHnw&oe=699DB0AF"}, {"file_name": "7zzgQO.png", "id": "531940097692264", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75299157_531940101025597_5251096014739210240_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PkFKIGu1YDMQ7kNvwFMxfGa&_nc_oc=AdlheXkLm5fIapJlnkRrs-vAW6tKpGnRSPGZ_l-Ug4yBFdhfVjWzdQ1tz1lqcC59r44&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuBcsYJCH2qvjKxAXuI1uAmAgAqYDqhybFACwQMmzL1uA&oe=699D80D0"}, {"file_name": "5Mpz9L.png", "id": "221495209305416", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035317_221495212638749_374869865195896832_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KHNP79PEb9cQ7kNvwEJQds3&_nc_oc=AdntQYqq35fbwEGwzO8QHIivMw1XgLcPEAY3iuxKCpT30B78qEfTEXfxVWhz2fp0o5c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvDijNkGbDQZX8o1rT_M6b6wTor4v30N_HynE9NkYwgsw&oe=699D9383"}, {"file_name": "uOlsk0.png", "id": "244667959986378", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036641_244667963319711_4654484053272035328_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=93v2VKOg9GwQ7kNvwFy-HEA&_nc_oc=AdnWY8jt_I0jFrIbR9lCa95jGaQjvi_EUffC37yYQilBHXKYn2ugkXwOPmtfnsi73ws&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsdu_NHr1o-44KrPGkizpEA0kh8H7xELPIT4xN0Q0jvaw&oe=699DAB60"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FNAFHW_TrailerCover_2560x1440.png", "id": "676657016245591", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75395600_676657019578924_7001247118161678736_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vcy_Xis5NPkQ7kNvwFXl13-&_nc_oc=AdmMM6StrlfVCcZ0-H3gt63yIqfzS5pcbhbIJWYgEHD28zOgHmvoRP6dVQgDVxmcU9I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfugQJeP3RviZT5IuRKEg_YZX-nQ0DjW_YD6piHAWIEgEQ&oe=699D8F82"}, "display_name": "Five Nights at Freddy's: Help Wanted", "keywords": ["freddy", "robot", "survival", "horror", "jumpscare"], "long_description": "Five Nights at Freddy\u2019s: Help Wanted is a virtual reality experience for the Oculus Quest. FNaF: HW is a collection of classic and original mini-games set in the Five Nights universe. Survive terrifying encounters with your favorite killer animatronics in a collection of new and classic FIVE NIGHTS AT FREDDY\u2019S\u2122 experiences. \u201cWhere fantasy and fun come to life!\u201d\n\n\nYOU\u2019RE HIRED - Repair claustrophobic ventilation systems, troubleshoot broken animatronics that could activate at any moment, or spend your evenings cowering in the nighttime security guard office. \nCELEBRATE - Confront your favorite killer animatronics including; Freddy, Bonnie, Chica, Foxy, Springtrap, The Mangle, Funtime Foxy, and Circus Baby. \nPIZZA PARTY - Scenes from classic titles have been updated for an immersive VR experience including;  Five Nights at Freddy\u2019s, Five Nights at Freddy\u2019s 2, Five Nights at Freddy\u2019s 3, Five Nights at Freddy\u2019s 4,  and Five Nights at Freddy\u2019s: Sister Location.", "short_description": "Five Nights at Freddy\u2019s: Help Wanted is a virtual reality experience for the Oculus Quest. FNaF: HW is a collection of classic and original mini-games set in the Five Nights universe. Survive terrifying encounters with your favorite killer animatronics in a collection of new and classic FIVE NIGHTS AT FREDDY\u2019S\u2122 experiences. \u201cWhere fantasy and fun come to life!\u201d"}]}, "developer_name": "Steel Wool Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.steelwoolstudios.com/legal/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ScottGames", "support_website_url": "https://www.steelw